#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:5
#: 771e5ba57a624ce0b6643be478aa869b
msgid "Wiki Editing - Setting Up the Environment"
msgstr "Wiki 编辑 - 搭建编辑环境"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:9
#: 80b69de9810b4e7fa81d76a7ddac877e
msgid ""
"Before submitting large changes to the wiki it is best to check the pages "
"are rendered correctly including checking all images and links appear "
"correctly.  This page explains how to \"build\" the wiki (i.e. convert the "
"rst files and image files into a set of html pages) on your local machine so"
" that you can perform these checks."
msgstr ""
"在向 wiki 提交大型修改之前，最好先检查页面是否正确渲染，包括所有图片和链接是否正常显示。本页面介绍如何在本地计算机上「构建」wiki（即将 rst"
" 文件和图片文件转换为一套 html 页面），以便进行这些检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:11
#: 9e78d9426f7540f29031051b3553c3f9
msgid "There are several methods to setup a local build environment:"
msgstr "搭建本地构建环境有以下几种方法："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:13
#: 4b79a524870448519eea80b3aab2eb64
msgid ""
"Use the `Vagrantfile "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/blob/master/Vagrantfile>`__ in "
"the root of the repo to create a Linux virtual machine with all the "
"necessary packages installed.  This is the preferred and supported method."
msgstr ""
"使用仓库根目录中的 `Vagrantfile "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/blob/master/Vagrantfile>`__ "
"创建已安装所有必要软件包的 Linux 虚拟机。这是首选且受支持的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:14
#: efc770ee19564e66a99185bc442b919e
msgid ""
"Use the `Dockerfile "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/blob/master/Dockerfile>`__ in "
"the root of the repo to create a Linux container with all the necessary "
"packages installed."
msgstr ""
"使用仓库根目录中的 `Dockerfile "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki/blob/master/Dockerfile>`__ "
"创建已安装所有必要软件包的 Linux 容器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:15
#: 91be0100eb894af58f6a5f2cbeba9b45
msgid ""
"Or simply install the required libraries on your local Linux or Windows "
"machine, using the instructions below."
msgstr "或者按照以下说明直接在本地 Linux 或 Windows 计算机上安装所需库。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:18
#: b88da334dd2e45d8bbccc7456d658f1c
msgid "Fork, Clone, and Update Your Copy of the Wiki"
msgstr "Fork、Clone 并更新您的 Wiki 副本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:20
#: 5d1cf33c8bd847468494bde528cd31c7
msgid ""
"First, the wiki should be forked and cloned much like :ref:`developers do "
"for the flight code <dev:where-to-get-the-code>`."
msgstr ""
"首先，应像 :ref:`开发者处理飞行代码一样 <dev:where-to-get-the-code>` Fork 并 Clone wiki。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:22
#: 675d8e61086d4568a176d6c05677df00
msgid ""
"Create a `Github account <https://github.com/join>`__ if you do not have one"
" already"
msgstr "如尚未拥有 `GitHub 账号 <https://github.com/join>`__，请先创建一个"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:23
#: 71d12cbce86846dd90eccddc93a98d8e
msgid ":ref:`Install a Git Client <dev:git-install>`"
msgstr ":ref:`安装 Git 客户端 <dev:git-install>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:24
#: 24e536eb46bc46bb99cb6726959a1f8e
msgid ""
":ref:`Fork <dev:git-fork>` the `ardupilot_wiki "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki>`__ to create your own copy in "
"GitHub (note linked instructions are for the ardupilot flight code so "
"\"ardupilot\" should be replaced with \"ardupilot_wiki\")"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Fork <dev:git-fork>` `ardupilot_wiki "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_wiki>`__ 以在 GitHub "
"上创建您自己的副本（注意链接的说明是针对 ardupilot 飞行代码的，应将「ardupilot」替换为「ardupilot_wiki」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:28
#: af3637d8bad144d485cc6ef01cd1c415
msgid ""
":ref:`Clone <dev:git-clone>` your copy of ardupilot_wiki on GitHub to your "
"local machine (note linked instructions are for the ardupilot flight code so"
" \"ardupilot\" should be replaced with \"ardupilot_wiki\")"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Clone <dev:git-clone>` 您在 GitHub 上的 ardupilot_wiki 副本到本地计算机（注意链接的说明是针对"
" ardupilot 飞行代码的，应将「ardupilot」替换为「ardupilot_wiki」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:34
#: aa6b24419e024321a49973fddd7aad04
msgid ""
"Be sure to keep your fork of the repository updated, both locally, and on "
"GitHub both as you install and as you develop new contributions. Be sure to "
"create a working branch locally when you start to make changes, pushing that"
" branch up to your GitHub repo, and then making a PR (pull-request from "
"there to the Wiki repo), in a manner similar to making :ref:`code PRs "
"<submitting-patches-back-to-master>`."
msgstr ""
"务必及时更新您 Fork 的仓库，无论是本地还是 GitHub 上，无论是安装时还是开发新贡献时。开始修改时务必在本地创建工作分支，将该分支推送到您的 "
"GitHub 仓库，然后从那里向 Wiki 仓库发起 PR（Pull Request），方式与 :ref:`代码 PR <submitting-"
"patches-back-to-master>` 类似。"

