#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:204
#: 8f05b0dba9e143d7a924cac2929fd190
msgid "Build options"
msgstr "构建选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:227
#: 40a66440f6074453845dad8cd65e02b9
msgid ""
"Most of the build options will only be used on the server that builds the "
"wiki. The options that editors are most likely to find useful are `--site "
"SITE` and `--fast`. `--site SITE` allows for building a single wiki rather "
"than building all of the wikis. This is a huge bump in speed already, but "
"sometimes checking changes across multiple wikis is necessary. The `--fast` "
"option skips downloading data needed for vehicle parameters, log messages, "
"and video thumbnails. This can be helpful when doing small formatting "
"changes or when new parameters/log messages are not needed for the build. "
"Newly added video thumbnails will be downloaded and cached for the next "
"build with `--fast` enabled."
msgstr ""
"大多数构建选项仅在服务器上构建 wiki 时使用。编辑者最常用的选项是 `--site SITE` 和 `--fast`。`--site SITE` "
"允许只构建单个 wiki 而非全部，这已大幅提升速度，但有时需要跨多个 wiki 检查修改。`--fast` "
"选项跳过下载飞行器参数、日志消息和视频缩略图所需的数据。在进行小型格式修改或不需要新参数/日志消息时很有帮助。启用 `--fast` "
"时，新添加的视频缩略图将被下载并缓存供下次构建使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:230
#: 8ef6dc5372664a59915ca7d44479e261
msgid "RST editing/previewing"
msgstr "RST 编辑/预览"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:232
#: 4c3831abb0a9496f90a54826c56ea354
msgid ""
"The tools described in this section can make it easier to edit RST files and"
" reduce the time required to preview changes."
msgstr "本节介绍的工具可使 RST 文件的编辑更加便捷，并减少预览修改所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:234
#: 03a33e0fae2c4be3a96012d8a013cbaf
msgid ""
"The RST rendering tools can be useful for rapidly previewing small changes "
"in the documentation. Rendering will not be perfect because the tools are "
"designed for generic reStructuredText (they and are not \"Sphinx-aware). We "
"therefore recommend that you build with Sphinx to do a final review before "
"you make a documentation pull request."
msgstr ""
"RST 渲染工具对于快速预览文档中的小改动很有用。渲染效果可能不完美，因为这些工具是为通用 reStructuredText 设计的（并非「Sphinx"
" 感知」）。因此建议在提交文档 Pull Request 之前使用 Sphinx 进行最终审查。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:237
#: d447fc5121604c87a73d49dd181ca207
msgid "RST rendering on Windows"
msgstr "Windows 上的 RST 渲染"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:239
#: a92f632cad0745a99e117a958918f7d1
msgid ""
"A combination of two Windows tools can help you preview your modifications:"
msgstr "两款 Windows 工具的组合可帮助您预览修改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:241
#: c37e3a9b2ed248bf905169033c484379
msgid ""
"`Notepad++ plugin for RST files "
