#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:245
#: 8fab3320f80442b186a4a13149a71a58
msgid ""
"The Notepad++ plugin helps you with code completion and syntax highlighting "
"during modification. Restview renders RST files on-the-fly, i.e. each "
"modification on the RST file can be immediately visualized in your web "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Notepad++ 插件在编辑时提供代码补全和语法高亮。Restview 即时渲染 RST 文件，即对 RST 文件的每次修改都可立即在浏览器中可视化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:249
#: 81cdaaec3a964bb3bb137ac6ff77318c
msgid ""
"The installation of the Notepad++ plugin is clearly explained on the "
"plugin's website (see above)."
msgstr "Notepad++ 插件的安装在插件网站（见上文）中有清晰说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:251
#: 0df2feccca434d959097fe13631d3483
msgid "Restview can be installed with:"
msgstr "Restview 可通过以下方式安装："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:257
#: d9e80d6b6585477faa1235eaebc6f353
msgid ""
"The restview executable will be installed in the **Scripts** folder of the "
"Python main folder. Restview will start the on-the-fly HTML rendering and "
"open a tab page in your preferred web browser."
msgstr ""
"restview 可执行文件将安装在 Python 主文件夹的 **Scripts** 文件夹中。Restview 将启动即时 HTML "
"渲染，并在您常用的浏览器中打开新标签页。"

