msgid ""
"`ReText <https://github.com/retext-project/retext>`__ is a Linux tool that "
"provides syntax highlighting and basic on-the-fly rendering in a single "
"application."
msgstr ""
"`ReText <https://github.com/retext-project/retext>`__ 是一款 Linux "
"工具，在单一应用中提供语法高亮和基本即时渲染。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wiki-editing-setup.rst:274
