msgid ""
"Although the tool is Python based, don't try it on Windows as it is very "
"prone to crashes (this is also stated by the website)."
msgstr "虽然该工具基于 Python，但不建议在 Windows 上尝试，因为它极易崩溃（网站上也有此说明）。"
